& [Folds]
  + F1 identity: UUID repository branch commit SHA256 profile and domain identities are exact
  + F2 temporal: candidate payload commit published envelope successor placement and one open tip are ordered without same-commit recursion
  + F3 structural: links form one bounded linear chain from pinned anchor to open tip
  + F4 semantic: candidate and published graphs are invariant except explicit publication fields and recomputed digests
  + F5 effect: supplied-data verification is pure with physical_contact false and no process or filesystem write
  + F6 adversarial: gaps forks overlaps drift tamper overbounds unknowns and authority widening are typed refusals
  + F7 operational: focused debug release workspace quality evidence attribution staged inventory commit push and bookend gates remain required

& [ExhaustionDecision]
  + the one-head-lag policy resolves the digest cycle at protocol level without weakening exact payload coverage
  + physical placement observation mutation and publication remain later frontiers
